/* Generated by xghost. Do not edit. */
/* Run 'xghost theme set <name>' to rebuild this file. */
/* */
/* The palette of the active theme, in the form the Rofi theme language reads. */
/* config/rofi/config.rasi loads this file with '@theme', which discards the */
/* default theme of Rofi and starts a fresh theme from these names. Every block */
/* of the prescribed file is parsed after this one and draws with these */
/* colours, so no colour of the launcher comes from outside the palette. */
/* */
/* The names are the palette names of the project in lower case, with a hyphen */
/* where the palette key holds an underscore. An underscore in a name of this */
/* language is a parse error, and Rofi reports it and exits zero. */
/* docs/bundles/rofi.md records that, and the names the dotfiles drew with that */
/* nothing ever defined. */

* {
    bg:          #0f1115;
    surface:     #1c1f26;
    surface-alt: #0f1115;
    text:        #e8e8ed;
    text-muted:  #a1a1aa;
    accent:      #0a84ff;
    accent-alt:  #64d2ff;
    warn:        #ffc934;
    error:       #ff453a;
    success:     #34c759;
}
